<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="paperformat_remito_bioagri" model="report.paperformat">
        <field name="name">Remito Bioagri</field>
        <field name="format">A4</field>
        <field name="orientation">Portrait</field>
        <field name="margin_top">5</field>
        <field name="margin_bottom">5</field>
        <field name="margin_left">10</field>
        <field name="margin_right">10</field>
        <field name="header_line" eval="False"/>
        <field name="header_spacing">0</field>
    </record>

    <record id="stock.action_report_delivery" model="ir.actions.report">
        <field name="report_name">bioagri_custom_addons.report_delivery_document_bioagri</field>
        <field name="paperformat_id" ref="bioagri_custom_addons.paperformat_remito_bioagri"/>
    </record>

    <template id="report_delivery_document_bioagri">
        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <style>
                    body, .container, .o_body_html, .o_body_pdf, main, #wrapwrap { padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; }
                </style>
                <div class="page" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333; font-size: 10px; padding: 8px;">
                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="width: 55%; vertical-align: top; border: none; padding-right: 10px;">
                                <table style="width: 100%; border: none;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 0; width: 40%;">
                                            <img t-if="o.company_id.logo" t-att-src="image_data_uri(o.company_id.logo)" style="max-height: 50px; max-width: 130px;" alt="Logo"/>
                                        </td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 0; vertical-align: top; font-size: 9px;">
                                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;" t-esc="o.company_id.name or ''"/>
                                            <p style="margin: 1px 0;" t-if="o.company_id.street">
                                                <span t-esc="o.company_id.street"/>
                                                <span t-if="o.company_id.city">, <span t-esc="o.company_id.city"/></span>
                                                <span t-if="o.company_id.zip"> CP. <span t-esc="o.company_id.zip"/></span>
                                            </p>
                                            <p style="margin: 1px 0;" t-if="o.company_id.state_id">
                                                <span t-esc="o.company_id.state_id.name"/> - Argentina
                                            </p>
                                            <p style="margin: 1px 0;" t-if="o.company_id.vat">C.U.I.T. <span t-esc="o.company_id.vat"/></p>
                                            <p style="margin: 1px 0;" t-if="o.company_id.phone">Telefono: <span t-esc="o.company_id.phone"/></p>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width: 45%; vertical-align: top; border: none; text-align: right;">
                                <table style="border-collapse: collapse; float: right;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: 2px solid #333; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
                                            <span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">R</span>
                                            <br/>
                                            <span style="font-size: 7px;">Cod. 91</span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td style="padding-left: 10px; vertical-align: top; text-align: left;">
                                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">REMITO</p>
                                            <p style="margin: 2px 0; font-size: 8px; color: #666;">DOCUMENTO NO VALIDO COMO FACTURA</p>
                                            <p style="margin: 2px 0; font-size: 12px;">N. <span t-esc="o.name or ''"/></p>
                                            <p style="margin: 2px 0; font-size: 8px;">Comprobante original</p>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="width: 55%; vertical-align: top; border: none; padding-right: 10px; font-size: 9px;">
                                <div style="margin-bottom: 4px;">
                                    <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-weight: bold;">Cliente</p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0;" t-esc="o.partner_id.name or ''"/>
                                    <p style="margin: 0;" t-if="o.partner_id.vat">C.U.I.T. <span t-esc="o.partner_id.vat"/></p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0;" t-if="o.partner_id.street">
                                        <span t-esc="o.partner_id.street"/>
                                        <span t-if="o.partner_id.city">, <span t-esc="o.partner_id.city"/></span>
                                        <span t-if="o.partner_id.state_id"> - <span t-esc="o.partner_id.state_id.name"/></span>
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-weight: bold;">Direccion de envio</p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0;" t-esc="o.partner_id.name or ''"/>
                                    <p style="margin: 0;" t-if="o.partner_id.street">
                                        <span t-esc="o.partner_id.street"/>
                                        <span t-if="o.partner_id.city">, <span t-esc="o.partner_id.city"/></span>
                                        <span t-if="o.partner_id.state_id"> - <span t-esc="o.partner_id.state_id.name"/></span>
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width: 45%; vertical-align: top; border: none; font-size: 9px;">
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 3px 0; font-weight: bold;">Informacion de expedicion</p>
                                <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; width: 45%;">Documento/Fecha</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;">
                                            <span t-esc="o.name or ''"/> / 
                                            <span t-if="o.date_done" t-esc="o.date_done.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')"/>
                                            <span t-if="not o.date_done and o.scheduled_date" t-esc="o.scheduled_date.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">N. Transporte/Fecha</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;">
                                            <span t-if="o.x_patente" t-esc="o.x_patente"/>
                                            <span t-if="o.date_done"> / <span t-esc="o.date_done.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')"/></span>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">Pedido/Fecha</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;">
                                            <span t-esc="o.origin or ''"/> / 
                                            <span t-if="o.date_done" t-esc="o.date_done.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')"/>
                                            <span t-if="not o.date_done and o.scheduled_date" t-esc="o.scheduled_date.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">Numero de cliente</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;" t-esc="o.partner_id.ref or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">Numero de destinatario</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;" t-esc="o.partner_id.ref or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">Transportista:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;" t-esc="o.x_transportista_id.name or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">CUIT transportista:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;" t-esc="o.x_transportista_id.vat or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="width: 35%; vertical-align: top; border: none; padding-right: 10px; font-size: 9px;">
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 3px 0; font-weight: bold;">Condiciones</p>
                                <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">Expedicion:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;" t-esc="o.note or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">Entrega</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;"></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">Deposito origen</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;" t-if="o.company_id.street">
                                            <span t-esc="o.company_id.street"/> - CP. <span t-esc="o.company_id.zip or ''"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-weight: bold;">Informacion</p>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width: 65%; vertical-align: top; border: none; font-size: 9px;">
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 3px 0; font-weight: bold;">TRANSPORTE</p>
                                <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; width: 30%; font-weight: bold;">Camion:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;" t-esc="o.x_patente or ''"/>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: bold;">Cot.</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;"></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">Acopiado:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;"></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">Chofer:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;" t-esc="o.x_chofer_nombre or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">DNI:</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;" t-esc="o.x_chofer_dni or ''"/>
                                    </tr>
                                    <t t-set="total_weight" t-value="sum([(move.quantity or move.product_uom_qty) * (move.product_id.weight or 0) for move in o.move_ids_without_package])"/>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: bold;">Peso - Volumen</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;"></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">Peso total</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;">
                                            <span t-esc="'%.2f KG' % total_weight"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0;">Peso neto</td>
                                        <td style="border: none; padding: 1px 0; text-align: right;">
                                            <span t-esc="'%.2f KG' % total_weight"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                    <div style="background: #FFF9C4; padding: 6px 10px; margin-bottom: 6px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #F9A825;">
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold; color: #E65100;">
                            EMERGENCIAS TOXICOLOGICAS: 0800-222-2933 (24 hs)
                        </p>
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold; color: #E65100;">
                            EN CASO DE ACCIDENTE DURANTE EL TRANSPORTE: 0800-222-2933 (24 hs)
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <p style="margin: 0 0 3px 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9px;">Detalles de expedicion</p>
                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
                        <thead>
                            <tr style="background: #f0f0f0;">
                                <th style="padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;">Posicion</th>
                                <th style="padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;">Material</th>
                                <th style="padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;">Descripcion</th>
                                <th style="padding: 4px 6px; text-align: right; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;">Cantidad</th>
                                <th style="padding: 4px 6px; text-align: right; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;">Cant alternativa</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <t t-foreach="o.move_ids_without_package" t-as="move">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;" t-esc="move_index + 1"/>
                                    <td style="padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;" t-esc="move.product_id.default_code or ''"/>
                                    <td style="padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px;" t-esc="move.product_id.name or ''"/>
                                    <td style="padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px; text-align: right;">
                                        <span t-esc="'%s %s' % (move.product_uom_qty, move.product_uom.name)"/>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #ccc; font-size: 9px; text-align: right;">
                                        <span t-if="move.product_uom_qty != move.quantity" t-esc="'%s %s' % (move.quantity, move.product_uom.name)"/>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </t>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>

                    <t t-set="has_lots" t-value="any(move.move_line_ids.lot_id or move.move_line_ids.lot_name for move in o.move_ids_without_package)"/>
                    <div t-if="has_lots" style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 9px;">
                        <t t-foreach="o.move_ids_without_package" t-as="move">
                            <t t-foreach="move.move_line_ids" t-as="ml">
                                <p t-if="ml.lot_id or ml.lot_name" style="margin: 1px 0;">
                                    <strong>Lote:</strong>
                                    <span t-esc="ml.lot_id.name or ml.lot_name or ''"/>
                                    <t t-if="ml.lot_id and ml.lot_id.expiration_date">
                                        <strong>Fecha de venc:</strong>
                                        <span t-esc="ml.lot_id.expiration_date.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')"/>
                                    </t>
                                </p>
                            </t>
                        </t>
                    </div>

                    <t t-set="total_packages" t-value="sum([move.quantity or move.product_uom_qty for move in o.move_ids_without_package])"/>
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 9px;">
                        <p style="margin: 1px 0;"><strong>Valor declarado:</strong></p>
                        <p style="margin: 1px 0;"><strong>Cant de bultos:</strong> <span t-esc="total_packages"/></p>
                        <p style="margin: 1px 0;"><strong>Cant de pallets:</strong></p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- ponytail: CAI fields (x_cai_number, x_cai_vencimiento) must be added to res.company model first -->
                    <div style="border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 8px;">
                        <span>N. CAI: _______________</span>
                        <span style="float: right;">Fecha de vencimiento: _______________</span>
                    </div>

                    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 7px;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="width: 55%; vertical-align: top; border: none; padding-right: 10px;">
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0;">1. <span t-esc="o.company_id.name or ''"/> entrega toda la mercaderia en perfectas condiciones y no acepta reclamos o responsabilidad por perdidas o danos durante el viaje.</p>
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0;">2. Cualquier reclamo a <span t-esc="o.company_id.name or ''"/> debe interponerse dentro de las 48 hs. inmediatas posteriores a la fecha de recepcion de mercaderia.</p>
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0;">3. El transportista reconoce en forma expresa haber recibido de <span t-esc="o.company_id.name or ''"/> las cartillas de emergencia correspondientes a los productos remitidos.</p>
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0;">4. El transportista asume la obligacion de descontaminar a su exclusivo cargo, costo y responsabilidad la unidad completa utilizada para transportar mercaderia, en forma inmediata posterior a la descarga de misma mercaderia, en un todo conforme con la Resolucion N.779/95.</p>
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0;">5. En caso de devolucion de los productos, el dador de carga estara obligado a cumplir las causales establecidas en los arts. 11, 41 y ss. de la Ley 2026-R (antes 7032) de Biocidas y Decreto Reglamentario N. 1567/2013, de la Provincia de Chaco.</p>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width: 45%; vertical-align: top; border: none; text-align: center;">
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 3px 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 9px;">RECIBI CONFORME</p>
                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-size: 8px;">FECHA DE ENTREGA:</p>
                                <div style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #333; padding-top: 3px;">
                                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 8px;"><strong>Firma</strong></p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 7px;">Aclaracion Firma</p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 7px;">Tipo DOC. Numero DOC.</p>
                                </div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>
